        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-murray-s-cube-law-cubic-radius-ratio-r1-3-r2-3-r0-3-at-gamma-4-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-oscillatory-to-steady-flux-rms-ratio-of-shuttle-streaming-at-the-calibrated-contraction-amplitude>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-peristalsis-pruning-coupling-spearman-rho-of-betti-1-loop-count-vs-contraction-amplitude-eps-gamma-1-8>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-peristaltic-net-transport-optimum-wavelength-lambda-l-organism-pure-peristalsis-i0-0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-physarum-polycephalum-specimen-enclosed-anastomosing-loop-count-betti-1>,
